se domain is it?'\nPriest of Pain rumbles in amusement. 'You should already know.'\nA mad torment skitters rapidly to its target!\nYour task 'Chasing Madness' has been updated.\nYou gain party experience! (0.003%)\nA mad torment's corpse returns to the Torment from which it arose.\n- 10. Loot a Dollop of Insanity from a mad torment 0/1 Torment, the Plane of Pain\nLoot Dollop of Insanity [item=148902] from a mad torment's corpse.\nA Dollop of Insanity was given to you.\n--You have looted a Dollop of Insanity from a mad torment's corpse.--\nYour task 'Chasing Madness' has been updated.\n- 11. Speak with a Priestess of Music in the Theater of Blood 0/1 Theater of Blood\nQuest Text: Speak with a Priestess of Ayonae Ro's in the Theater of Blood for any information as to this mystery.\nAnother mobs spawns with this step, same level and strength. Loot the item from its corpse.\nYou say, 'Hail, Priestess of Music'\nPriestess of Music says, 'Ah, a sane soul! With Mayong's loss of divinity, it is so comforting to see another here not touched by his power. What [brings] you to the recovering Demi-Plane of Music?'\nYou say, 'Ayonae Ro's status brings me. Is she well?'\nPriestess of Music says, 'The Maestra continues to recover in her tower! We appreciate your concern, friendly mortal, and will pass your well wishes along. With this Demi-Plane a manifestation of her music, will, and experiences, it will take some time to return to something untouched by the former Blood God's [influence].'\nYou say, 'The influence will be felt by many for some time.'\nPriestess of Music says, 'Yes. The [madness] he put her through in order to take and twist her Demi-Plane... His was but borrowed power and this Theater but a borrowed Plane.'\nYou say, 'What can you tell me of her madness?'\nPriestess of Music says, 'It was but a tool to create for Mayong. The madness originated with him, but the Demi-Plane you see here is still her song. She has changed the key and the tempo, but that doesn't change that we still must [reach] the codetta before moving on.'\nYou say, 'May she reach it in her time.'\nPriestess of Music agrees, 'Everything in time. You have a friend who is suffering madness, yes? Please, help me help a friend move on to their part in the next verse, and perhaps they can help you in your own way.' She calls an old friend.\nA mad griever stares with wide, begging eyes.\nYour task 'Chasing Madness' has been updated.\nYou gain party experience! (0.005%)\nA mad griever's corpse screams, the sound starting shrill but soon joins the harmony of the land around her.\nA mad griever has been slain!\n- 12. Loot a Smidgen of Loss from a mad griever 0/1 Theater of Blood\nA Smidgen of Loss was given to you.\n--You have looted a Smidgen of Loss from a mad griever's corpse.--\nYour task 'Chasing Madness' has been updated.\nThe Smidgen of Loss wrenches at your heart, but it sounds as though it will fit in this puzzle.\n- 13. Speak with Zebuxoruk in the Void 0/1 The Void\nQuest Text: Speak with Zebuxoruk the Ungod in The Void for any information as to this mystery.\nThis step, you need to go to The Void that's off of Ethernere Tainted West Karana.\nYou say, 'Hail, Zebuxoruk'\nZebuxoruk says, 'You come again. Who do you propose made his visions this time? You take on the experiences of your life, your experiences of every battle you have fought, and the challenges that you have won and conquered. Have you met her this cycle? No, no, for she is illusive, isn't she? Through timelines I have seen you help Gaius, and I have seen you fail, and I have seen you succeed, yet you have yet to find her before you seek me, don't you? In any case, take this, as I know you'll need it, as you have before.'\nYour task 'Chasing Madness' has been updated.\n- 14. Receive a Pinch of Foresight from Zebuxoruk 0/1 The Void\nThe Pinch of Foresight may be what completes this mysterious recipe.\nYou have been given: Pinch of Foresight\nYour task 'Chasing Madness' has been updated.\n- 15. 